      },
      "description": "Offline Linux hardware and driver diagnostics with CPU/GPU graphs and a hardware-rendered Pulse.",
      "compatibility_notes": "Requires Linux, Python 3.8+ and system Tkinter. Pulse additionally requires X11/XWayland, EGL/GLES2 and a compatible hardware driver. Real Lima utilization, GPU frequency, keyboard controls and overlay performance were tested on PocketCHIP. GPU access and tear-free presentation require the Shell PocketCHIP platform setup with its private trace reader and VSync compositor. Managed App Center update to this version was not physically exercised.",
